{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is detected, pick it up, check properties and place it in the container, or move to the object, else scan for others. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = PlaceObjectInContainer    /> <Action ID = MoveToDetectedObject    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = CheckProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />",
